---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const title = "For Investors | Finance and Governance in Portfolio Companies | MENADD";
const description =
  "For funds and family offices: an operating CFO and board advisor for portfolio companies that are growing faster than their finance and governance.";
---

<Base title={title} description={description} canonical="/investors/" ogImage="/og/shared.png" ogImageAlt="Gennady Shafir, CFO and board advisor" wide>
  <div class="investors-page twelve-column-grid">
    <section class="investors-intro">
      <h1>For investors</h1>
      <p class="lede">A portfolio company is growing faster than its finance and governance. The founder is capable. The numbers and the structure are behind the business. I take the operating side.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="investors-sections">
      <section>
        <h2>When it makes sense</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Before a follow-on round, when the cap table and the instruments need to reconcile to signed documents.</li>
          <li>After a round, when reporting obligations start and the company has no one to meet them.</li>
          <li>When the structure blocks the next investment: the wrong entity, IP in the wrong place, equity promised and never issued.</li>
          <li>When the board and the founder read the same numbers differently.</li>
          <li>Before you invest, when you want the structure and the ownership record checked by someone who has run a company.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>What I do inside the company</h2>
        <p>Cash reporting built from the bank accounts. A runway figure the board can rely on. A cap table that matches the documents. Board and investor reporting on a fixed rhythm. Structural fixes ahead of the next round, run with counsel.</p>
        <p>I work with the founder, not above the founder. The company gets a senior finance operator. You get reporting you do not have to rebuild.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Where this comes from</h2>
        <p>I have been CEO, COO and CFO in venture-backed companies. I have done diligence work on both sides of the table. I have seen a transaction fail on structure while the business was working.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="investors-cta">
        <h2>Introduce me to the founder, or send me the situation.</h2>
        <a class="button-link" href="/start/?type=investor">Start a conversation</a>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
